<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> It is a comb binded stack of printer paper, with the front cover reading “Bomb Defusal 101”. The rest of the papers show a way to defuse any bomb using the steps shown. However, when the reader is within 25’ of a bomb, the pages regarding that type of bomb appear to be blank, although analysis of video footage shows it is still there, just incomprehensible to people around the bomb.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> An event where, during testing, the book blanked out an unexpected page. It revealed a planned (and abandoned) attack by an unknown hostile goi.</p>
